@Orders.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:3000
@CorrelationId = bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb
# Substitua pelo id devolvido pela criação para consultar o pedido.
@OrderId = aaaaaaaa-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa

### Saúde e readiness
GET {{Orders.Api_HostAddress}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json

### Criar o pedido canônico (subtotal 50000, desconto 5000, total 45000)
POST {{Orders.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: {{CorrelationId}}

{
  "customer": {
    "name": "Cliente Exemplo",
    "email": "cliente@example.com"
  },
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
      "quantity": 2
    },
    {
      "productId": "22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222",
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

### Listar resumos de pedidos
GET {{Orders.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/orders?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: {{CorrelationId}}

### Consultar um pedido pelo id retornado acima
GET {{Orders.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/orders/{{OrderId}}
Accept: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: {{CorrelationId}}
